  "description": "James Rayner has long endured the Council’s oppressive rule over the society of other creatures—but everything changes when he meets Kenta, a spirited werewolf working at a quiet convenience store. What begins as an unlikely friendship turns into something deeper, and the mark they share awakens an ancient power the Council both fears and covets. As love and destiny collide, James must face a choice: protect their bond or risk watching their world burn.\nSource: Webtoon",
